    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dynamic open-world experience where you choose your fate\u2014will you uphold the law or break it? In <i>The Prisonbreak</i>, you can either serve as a police officer, hunting down criminals and restoring order, or embrace the life of crime, escaping from prison, running heists, and building your own criminal empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Side</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Play as a Police Officer:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep criminals locked up and prevent escapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase down fugitives and bring them back to justice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the city from organized crime and dismantle enemy bases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn bounties for capturing high-profile criminals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Play as a Criminal:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from prison using tools, weapons, or bribery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rob stores, banks, and other locations to amass wealth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down cops before they catch you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own gang and establish a secure base.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 <strong>Online Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends or go solo in this action-packed world.<br>\u2b50 <strong>Base Building</strong> \u2013 Construct a personal home or a high-security criminal hideout.<br>\u2b50 <strong>Bounty System</strong> \u2013 Earn rewards for taking down high-profile criminals.<br>\u2b50 <strong>Heists &amp; Robberies</strong> \u2013 Plan tactical break-ins and increase your fortune.<br>\u2b50 <strong>Reputation System</strong> \u2013 Good behavior is rewarded, while rule-breakers face consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the enforcer of justice or the mastermind of crime? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Wishlist now and prepare for the ultimate battle between law and chaos!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dynamic open-world experience where you choose your fate\u2014will you uphold the law or break it? In <i>The Prisonbreak</i>, you can either serve as a police officer, hunting down criminals and restoring order, or embrace the life of crime, escaping from prison, running heists, and building your own criminal empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Side</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Play as a Police Officer:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep criminals locked up and prevent escapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase down fugitives and bring them back to justice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the city from organized crime and dismantle enemy bases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn bounties for capturing high-profile criminals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Play as a Criminal:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from prison using tools, weapons, or bribery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rob stores, banks, and other locations to amass wealth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down cops before they catch you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own gang and establish a secure base.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 <strong>Online Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends or go solo in this action-packed world.<br>\u2b50 <strong>Base Building</strong> \u2013 Construct a personal home or a high-security criminal hideout.<br>\u2b50 <strong>Bounty System</strong> \u2013 Earn rewards for taking down high-profile criminals.<br>\u2b50 <strong>Heists &amp; Robberies</strong> \u2013 Plan tactical break-ins and increase your fortune.<br>\u2b50 <strong>Reputation System</strong> \u2013 Good behavior is rewarded, while rule-breakers face consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the enforcer of justice or the mastermind of crime? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Wishlist now and prepare for the ultimate battle between law and chaos!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p>",
    "short_description": "Choose your side \u2013 cop or criminal! Keep criminals locked up or escape, rob stores, and build your crime empire. Play with friends, create bases, and earn bounties. Action, strategy, and adrenaline-filled gameplay await!",
